      <h3 style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">Where to Find This Information</h3>
      <p>Check these documents from your insurer:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Folleto Informativo (Policy Summary):</strong> This official 2-3 page summary must explicitly state "sin copago" or list copay amounts. Request this in both Spanish and English.</li>
        <li><strong>Certificado de Cobertura (Certificate of Coverage):</strong> This one-page document is what you submit with your visa application. It must clearly show "sin copago."</li>
        <li><strong>Póliza (Full Policy Document):</strong> The complete contract details all terms. Look for "Copago" or "Cuota" sections and verify they state zero amounts.</li>
